| ========================================================== |
| Test: Module Imports (Random, OS, Web) |
| ========================================================== |
**Import**($Random)@also%~random!`global`:random
**Import**($Os)@also%~os!`global`:os
**Import**($Website)@also%~web!`global`:web

| ========================================================== |
| Test: Loops (for with step, while) |
| ========================================================== |

| For loop with default step (+1) |
**Loop** <for>(~x=1&=5) [
    <printf>^("For loop x={x}\n")
]

| For loop with custom step (+2) |
**Loop** <for>(~i=1(2)&=5) [
    <printf>^("For loop with step i={i}\n")
]

| For loop with step +3 |
**Loop** <for>(~j=0(3)&=9) [
    <printf>^("For loop step 3 j={j}\n")
]

| While loop using @loop syntax |
int(3)~loop_count
@loop(loop_count > 0)
**Loop** <for.f.whle>@also [
    <printf>^("While loop iteration, count={loop_count}\n")
    <now>(loop_count - 1)>loop_count
]

| ========================================================== |
| Test: Using imported modules |
| ========================================================== |
[
    | Use Random module |
    int(<$random>(1, 100))~rand_val
    <printf>^("Random value: {rand_val}\n")

    | Use OS module |
    <$os>("test_simple.ko")~file_content
    <printf>^("OS read file length: {len(file_content)}\n")

    | Use Web module |
    <$web>("https://google.com")~web_result
    <printf>^("Web fetch result length: {len(web_result)}\n")
]
